        "metadata": {
          "author": "Momma Bear Audio",
          "description": "Are you ready to put your football knowledge to the test? Join Ms. Jenna for Football Trivia Challenge, an interactive audio game packed with 30 football questions across 10 exciting rounds!Kids will tackle everything from football positions, uniforms and scoring to stadium traditions, game-day routines, incredible records and silly football facts. With a mix of multiple-choice, true-or-false and “Who Am I?” questions, there’s something for football fans of all skill levels!How to play: Listen carefully to each question, choose your answer and earn one point for every correct response. Keep track of your score on your fingers or a piece of paper, and pause whenever you need extra thinking time.Along the way, kids practice listening, recall and critical thinking while expanding their football knowledge. Whether they’re just learning the game or already know their touchdowns from their field goals, there’s plenty to discover!Run Time: 28min\n\nLooking for other free audio sources, ideas and inspo? Maybe you want to submit a request for some sort of specific audio for your kids? Join my FB Group! I am always taking suggestions and working to get the audio your kids want.\nToyo Momma Bear source: 7498ba27780620ed424e24e8db157cf8bb0958ad62c672b3da206493992e2b5e",
